            "sid": "JOB 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoba hakumwakula Yehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi; Neluki nami wunatweshi kwila yuma yejima; nami hikudi natweshi kukulekesha muwuna-tondi kwilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu wukujinda mpùŋa yakadi maana hinyi? Komana ami nahoshi dehi yuma yinabulili kwiluka, yuma yakuhayama yabadikili mumaanami, yinayambili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalembi dehi mwani, tiyaku munukukeŋa kuhosha, yami nukukwihuleyi, eyi wunlejami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakutiyili kwamumatu hohu, ichi dinu nakumoni namesu ami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dichi dinu nadimoni dehi nami natama, nabalumuki dehi mumuchima mulunkuŋu namawuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chineli Yehova nahoshi dehi naYoba mazu awa, Yehova hakumwila Elifwazi wakuTemani nindi, Ami nazuwi dehi naneyi nawamabwambu jeyi ayedi, muloŋa munabuli kuntena chachiwahi neyi chananteniyi kambuŋami Yoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu kwatenu mayoŋa aŋombi amayala atanu nayedi, niyizamba yanyikoku yitanu nayiyedi, muyi kudi kambuŋami Yoba, himulambu li nyilambu yenu yakushita, akayilombeli kudi kambuŋami Yoba, Muloŋa diyi nukwitiyami, kulonda nakabuli kuyikoŋa mwashika wusupi wenu; Muloŋa munabuli kuntena mwamuwahi neyi chananteniyi kambuŋami Yoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi aElifwazi wakuTemani, naBilidadi wakuShuhi, naZofwari wakuNayamati ayili, elili mwayilejeliyi Yehova, Yehova wamwitiyili Yoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chayilombeleliyi amabwambu jindi, Yehova hakubalumuna wukoli waYoba. Yehova hakumuhetesha Yoba, hakumulunjikilamu niyikwawu yashikila muyakusambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana kwindi ejima, niahelindi ejima, niantu ejima adilukiliyi nawu hakusambila, hiyakwinza kudi yena nakudya nindi yakudya mwitala dindi. Hiyakudihuŋisha kunyitu, hiyakumukundeja nakutama kwejima kwamuleteleluwu kudi Yehova. Antu ejima hiyakumwinka iwu idali, iwu idali; hiyakumwinka nituzeya twawuru wejima wawu, iwu kamu, iwu kamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumukoolekesha Yoba; kukooleka kwamukoolekesheliyi kwakukuminina kwabadikili kwakusambila. Hakwikala nanyikoku makombakaji ikumi nawana, anŋameli makombakaji atanu nadimu, aŋombi anyidimu makombakaji ayedi, ayimbulu awakaji ikombakaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuvwala nawa anyana amayala atanu nayedi, awambanda asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamumbanda wakusambila wanamutumbili ijina dindi, nindi Yemima; wamumbanda wamuchiyedi nawa, ijina dindi Keziya; wamumbanda wamuchisatu nawa, ijina dindi Kereni Hapuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwituŋa dejima himwamwekeni ambanda akweti lubanji neyi anyana kaYobaku. Tata yawu wayinkeli wuswana wawu hamu nawana kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufuma henohu Yoba wanuŋiluku nyaka nkulakaji namakumi awana, wamweni ni anyanindi niezukulu indi, makiŋu awana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoba afwa ni kufwa, wela dehi kashinakaji, mafuku indi amuvulila dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
